    solidify.offset = 1\n    solidify.use_flip_normals = True\n    solidify.material_offset = 1\n    \n    # Assign outline material to the second slot\n    obj.data.materials.append(mat_outline)\n```\n</SYSTEM_MESSAGE>"}
